## Json deploy file

### Parameters in file

* targets -> multiple deploys
* type -> 'look in deploy types'
* workingPath -> the path to the dist folder
* customerName -> customer name
* areaName -> area name
* hostName -> host name
* deployTarget -> the target to deploy
* target -> Target specified deploy attribute

target deploy attributes: \

* clientType -> if modulebuilder then MODULEBUILDER else leave out
* deployType -> if modulebuilder then SCRIPTS,RELEASE,\\"\\" else leave out
* silentDeploy -> true or false. Is the deploy wizard visible / true is not tested
* ssisDeploymentWizardExe -> path to ssis deployment wizard exe
* ssasDeploymentWizardExe -> path to ssas deployment wizard exe
* sapIqDsn -> Odbc dsn name, username, password
* moduleName -> module name
* folderName -> name of the database folder, in the module, that have the patch folder
* fromName -> Patch from version
* toName -> Patch to version
* userParam -> a key value list of user parameters that you want to replace in deploy_sql.bat



### deploy types

* VsDb -> visual studio database project. Deploys all 'publish.xml' files from 'cs_db' folder. (\$CUSTOMERNAME\$,\$AREANAME\$,\$HOSTNAME\$,\$VERSIONNAME\$,\$INSTALLFOLDER\$) is replaced in file name and in file text.
* GlobalBin -> Replace (\$CUSTOMERNAME\$,\$AREANAME\$,\$HOSTNAME\$,\$VERSIONNAME\$,\$INSTALLFOLDER\$) in file name and in file text. Then copy all files and folders to %KMDHOME%\Bin. Overwrites files in bin
* GlobalConfig -> Replace (\$CUSTOMERNAME\$,\$AREANAME\$,\$HOSTNAME\$,\$VERSIONNAME\$,\$INSTALLFOLDER\$) in file name and in file text. Then copy all files and folders to %KMDHOME%\Config. Do not Overwrite file in config  
* Sql -> executes bin\\deploy_sql.bat this runs a sqlcmd. Which executes '00_MasterScript.sql' in 'sql' folder in module. Parameters defined in build.proj is added as additional parameters, and \$CUSTOMERNAME\$ is replaced if present
**deploy_sql.bat: CUSTOMERNAME %2, AREANAME %3, DATAAREALIST %4 - %5 and so on as many as in the build.proj, USERNAME %5, DeployType %6, COUNTRYCODE %7
* Ssis -> Deploys all 'ispac' files from 'ssis' folder, to Integration Services Catalogs, on the sql server. Ssis deploy uses KMDBI database to execute stored procedure 'dbo.CreateSSISFolder'
* IqSql -> Deploys '00_MasterScript.sql' script from 'iqsql' folder. Reference other scripts with :r notation to install them.
-- $(DistPath) --> workingPath,
-- $(Role) --> Role_ + customerName
-- $(CustomerName) --> customerName
is replaced in files.

* Ssas -> Deploys all 'asdatabase' files from 'ssas' folder, to Analysis Services on sql server
  * Tabular deployment is done by doing the following
    * change build.proj <SSAS_tabular>src\ssas\DCAR\DCAR\DCAR.smproj</SSAS_tabular>
    * change .smproj file:
      * <OutputPath>..\\..\\..\\..\dist\lbf_dma_dcar\ssas</OutputPath>
      * Copy all Deployment- (fx. DeploymentServerName) properties to to first PropertyGroup

* Pre -> Executes all bat, ps1(powershel 7) files in 'preInstall' folder. 2 args are added in the following order customerName, areaName, moduleWorkingPath
* Post -> Executes all bat, ps1(powershel 7) files in 'postInstall' folder. 2 args are added in the following order customerName, areaName, moduleWorkingPath
* Web -> Deploys all '.deploy.cmd' to IIS
* SqlPatch -> executes bin\\deploy_sql_patches.bat this runs a sqlcmd. Which executes '00_Scripts.sql' in 'Patches' folder in module



